A||||12||HugGRRRFiero||Fiero Heater Coil Thingy?||||5||
Z||000000||HugGRRRFiero||09-14-2000||05:37 PM||||I ran across this Fiero part on eBay and not sure what it is exactly, nor does the guy selling it.  Not picking on him, but I've noticed this guy named or described a few other parts wrong on his other auctions, but this one's got me stumped.<P> <IMG SRC="http://watchsnmor.tripod.com/fiero090.jpg"> <P>He states:<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>PART DESCRIPTION: This is a interesting little coiled gadget from the front of the dash in a 1986 Fiero coupe. Fits all model years I believe. Guaranteed to work, I believe it is a heater coil.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Here's the part on eBay.<BR><A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/ebayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=436269482&r=0&t=0" TARGET=_blank>** Pontiac Fiero Heater Coil ?**</A><P>Now I've had the dash & HVAC unit out and completely apart from an '84 Fiero and I don't remember seeing this thing.  Can anyone shed any light on what it is or does?<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">   <BR>   <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Rodrv6||09-14-2000||05:49 PM||||That is the resistor unit that gives you the different speeds for the heater fan.  It is installed near the fan motor on the heater box.  The springs are out of site inside the heater box so that they can be cooled by the air the fan is moving.  The outside has an electrical plug on it.<P>------------------<BR>Rod Schneider, Woodstock, Ga.  84 SE||||reg||3
Z||000002||HugGRRRFiero||09-14-2000||06:05 PM||||Ahhh that explains it, the name "heater coil" was really confusing me.  I remember unplugging the plug for it now, but not removing the resistor from the box.  Cool, Thank you Rodrv6.||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||09-14-2000||10:26 PM||||I don't know why it's on auction....... can't be worth more than a dollar or 3. I'd be very suprised if that's not used on a multitude of GM product.||||reg||1
